       <h1>CAT 2026 Hall Ticket Releasing Tomorrow on iimcat.ac.in</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#Careers</span> <span>#CAT 2026</span> <span>#Hall Ticket</span></div>
       <p>The Common Admission Test (CAT) 2026 hall tickets are scheduled for release tomorrow, according to India Today. Candidates can access and download their hall tickets from the official website, iimcat.ac.in.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-03/cat-2026-hall-ticket-releasing-tomorrow-on-iimcatacin.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This release is crucial for all applicants preparing for the CAT 2026 examination, as the hall ticket is a mandatory document for entry to the test center.</p><p>Further details on the download process will be available on the iimcat.ac.in portal upon the hall ticket's release, as reported by India Today.</p><p>What to watch: The official website for download instructions.</p>
