       <h1>Cody Rhodes Returns to Suits After Fashion Teasing</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#sports</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes recently abandoned an attempt to wear casual polos after being teased by his wife, Brandi Rhodes, alongside Chelsea Green and Matt Cardona. Rhodes explained that his preference for suits developed while away from WWE, evolving into a professional standard he adopted from Ric Flair's glamorous style rather than his father Dusty Rhodes' blue-collar aesthetic.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-03/cody-rhodes-returns-to-suits-after-fashion-teasing.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Rhodes will next compete at WWE Crown Jewel on November 7 in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, where he faces Randy Orton in a Last Man Standing Match. The two wrestlers have split their previous two meetings, with Rhodes winning at WrestleMania 42 and Orton victorious in their September rematch.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately summarizes the background, personal anecdote, and upcoming match details cleanly.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
