      <a href="/feed.xml" title="RSS">RSS</a>
      <button id="tdp-theme" title="Toggle light/dark">Light</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/finance">finance</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="finance">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">FINANCE</span> · Livemint Money · 2026-11-03 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Gold and Silver Prices Drop in Kolkata Ahead of Festive Season</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#finance</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Gold and silver prices in Kolkata declined significantly on November 3 as buyers prepare for Dhanteras on November 6 and Diwali on November 8. 24-karat gold fell 1% to ₹1,38,830 per 10 grams, while 999 fine silver dropped 2.64% to ₹1,78,710 per kg. </p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-03/gold-and-silver-prices-drop-in-kolkata-ahead-of-festive-seas.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This downward trend mirrors global and domestic futures markets, where gold and silver prices also traded lower. Current rates reflect a sharp correction from October, when gold was priced at ₹1,50,100 per 10 grams and silver at ₹2,25,920 per kg. Analysts note that final retail prices for consumers may vary based on making charges, GST, and individual jeweller policies.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief correctly reports the price data and provides the necessary context for the festive season.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.livemint.com/money/personal-finance/gold-silver-rate-today-kolkata-nov-3-latest-price-movement-update-city-of-joy-investors-ahead-of-dhanteras-diwali-11793687795406.html" rel="noopener">Livemint Money</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/kolkata/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kolkata</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-03/gold-and-silver-prices-drop-in-kolkata-ahead-of-festive-seas" data-title="Gold and Silver Prices Drop in Kolkata Ahead of Festive Season"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
