     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-11-03 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Kochi Corporation Council Passes Electoral Roll Resolution Amid BJP Walkout</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Kochi Corporation Council passed a resolution criticizing Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar over alleged irregularities in the Special Intensive Revision of electoral rolls. The motion, supported by UDF and LDF members, claims the process stripped over 13 crore voters of their rights, thereby damaging the constitutional position.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-03/kochi-corporation-council-passes-electoral-roll-resolution-a.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>BJP councillors staged a walkout in protest, citing interruptions and ridicule by UDF members during the debate. While BJP representative Priya Prasanth argued that 2.50 crore removals involved deceased persons, the resolution was declared passed in the opposition's absence. Mayor V.K. Minimol defended the proceedings as being in keeping with the democratic spirit.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately summarizes the council meeting, the resolution's claims, and the BJP's protest.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/kochi-corporation-council-passes-sir-resolution-amid-protests-bjp-councillors-walk-out/article71660649.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/kochi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kochi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
