     <article class="story single" data-beat="sports">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · NDTV Sports · 2026-11-03 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Raquel Rodriguez Recalls Ringside Run-in With CM Punk</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#sports</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Women's Intercontinental Champion Raquel Rodriguez recounted a March 24, 2025, dark match encounter where she charged at CM Punk at ringside. Rodriguez claimed she captured the incident on her Meta glasses, noting that Cody Rhodes intervened to prevent the confrontation from escalating as Punk moved away.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-03/raquel-rodriguez-recalls-ringside-run-in-with-cm-punk.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Rodriguez, who recently defended her title across a South American tour, expressed value in working alongside experienced performers like Punk and Rhodes. While Rodriguez faces competition from IYO SKY, Punk is scheduled to challenge Grayson Waller for the NXT Championship before facing Kevin Owens in a No Holds Barred Match on SmackDown.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Captures the ringside incident, Meta glasses detail, and upcoming schedules precisely.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/us/wwe/cm-punk-wanted-nothing-to-do-with-raquel-rodriguez-during-a-wwe-ringside-encounter-12277568#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
