     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-11-03 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Supreme Court Flags Illegal Firecracker Sales in Delhi</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Supreme Court has directed the Centre to investigate reports of unrestricted firecracker sales in Delhi markets, despite judicial restrictions. Justices MM Sundresh and Prasanna B Varale highlighted media reports showing licensed and unlicensed products, some lacking mandatory QR codes, being sold openly. </p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-03/supreme-court-flags-illegal-firecracker-sales-in-delhi.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>On November 2, the court permitted only certified green firecrackers for sale between November 4 and 6, with specific bursting windows on November 7 and 8. The directives mandate QR-coded packaging and prohibit online sales or barium-based crackers. Reports indicate vendors in areas like Chandni Chowk and Sadar Bazaar are bypassing these rules by keeping conventional crackers hidden until requested by customers.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately summarizes the Supreme Court's directives and the specific context of the illegal sales reports.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/licensed-unlicensed-everything-available-sc-flags-reports-of-unrestricted-firecracker-sales-in-delhi-ws-l-10410290.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/delhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Delhi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-03/supreme-court-flags-illegal-firecracker-sales-in-delhi" data-title="Supreme Court Flags Illegal Firecracker Sales in Delhi"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
         <a class="sh-tg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.4 1.6 1.6 7l3.6 1.2L6 13l2.2-3.1 3.4 2.4 2.8-10.7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Telegram</a> ·
         <a class="sh-x" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.6 2.6l10.8 10.8M13.4 2.6 2.6 13.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>X</a> ·
         <a href="#" class="sh-copy"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6.6 9.4a3 3 0 0 0 4.2 0l1.8-1.8A3 3 0 1 0 8.4 3.4L7.5 4.3M9.4 6.6a3 3 0 0 0-4.2 0L3.4 8.4a3 3 0 1 0 4.2 4.2l.9-.9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Copy link</a> ·
