       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">TECH</span> · TechCrunch · 2026-11-03 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>TechCrunch Founder Summit 2026 to Convene in Boston</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#tech</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The TechCrunch Founder Summit 2026 will take place on November 4 at Boston’s SoWa Power Station. The event offers founders and investors a full day of practical learning, networking, and live pitching, featuring sessions on scaling, fundraising, and team building.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-03/techcrunch-founder-summit-2026-to-convene-in-boston.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Programming is divided into the Build Stage, focusing on early-stage mechanics like distribution and investor relations, and the Impact Stage, which covers scaling and product-market fit. Speakers include leaders from Toast, HqO, and Fidelity Private Shares. Attendees are encouraged to register early to avoid price increases at the door.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief provides a concise and accurate summary of the event details, programming structure, and key speakers.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
