      <ul><li><a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/03/the-techcrunch-founder-summit-agenda-is-only-half-the-reason-to-be-in-boston-on-nov-4/" rel="noopener">TechCrunch</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
